{
  "title": "EC2 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "필요한 성능의 가상 서버를 만들고 애플리케이션을 실행합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#guide-1\">인스턴스를 구성하는 요소</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#guide-2\">가용성과 운영 비용</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>15 / 62</span></div><h1>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EC2는 <strong>AWS에서 가상 서버를 만들어 사용하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 서버 한 대를 인스턴스라고 부르며, CPU·메모리·네트워크 성능을 선택해 웹 서버나 배치 작업 등을 실행합니다.</p><p>운영체제와 애플리케이션을 직접 설정할 수 있어 구성이 자유롭습니다. 그만큼 운영체제 업데이트, 실행 프로그램의 보안, 서버 용량 관리도 함께 계획해야 합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"instance-families\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"general-purpose-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"compute-optimized-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"memory-optimized-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"storage-optimized-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"accelerated-computing-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"high-performance-computing-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"burstable-performance-and-cpu-credits\"></span><h2>인스턴스를 구성하는 요소</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>로 운영체제와 기본 소프트웨어를 선택하고, <strong>인스턴스 유형</strong>으로 필요한 CPU와 메모리를 정합니다. 일반적인 웹 서버는 범용, 계산 작업은 컴퓨팅 최적화, 큰 데이터를 메모리에 올리는 작업은 메모리 최적화 유형을 검토합니다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>와 서브넷으로 배치 위치를 정하고, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">보안 그룹</a>으로 연결을 허용합니다. 파일과 운영체제를 보관할 디스크로는 보통 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>를 연결합니다.</p><p>AWS 서비스 접근에는 액세스 키를 서버에 저장하기보다 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM 역할</a>을 연결합니다. 실행 시 필요한 설정 작업은 사용자 데이터에 넣어 자동화할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fixed-performance-and-flex-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ec2-purchasing-options\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"instance-type-and-architecture\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ami-and-launch-template\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"instance-lifecycle\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ebs-and-instance-store\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"networking-and-security\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"iam-role-and-imdsv2\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"user-data-and-monitoring\"></span><h2>가용성과 운영 비용</h2><p>웹 서비스는 여러 AZ에 인스턴스를 배치하고 로드 밸런서와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>을 함께 사용하면 장애와 수요 변화에 대응하기 쉽습니다.</p><p>인스턴스를 중지해도 보관 중인 EBS 등의 비용은 남을 수 있습니다. 인스턴스 스토어<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>의 데이터는 중지·종료 등에 대비해 별도의 영구 저장소에 보관해야 합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>EC2 서버를 준비하는 순서</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>서버 환경</strong><span>AMI·인스턴스 유형</span></li><li><strong>배치와 저장</strong><span>서브넷·디스크</span></li><li><strong>접근 설정</strong><span>보안 그룹·IAM 역할</span></li><li><strong>실행·운영</strong><span>모니터링·확장</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">서버 사양뿐 아니라 저장소, 연결, 운영 방식을 함께 선택합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>웹 애플리케이션이 설치된 AMI를 준비하고 두 AZ에 EC2를 실행합니다. 로드 밸런서로 요청을 분산하고 방문자가 늘면 Auto Scaling으로 서버를 추가합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>인스턴스 스토어</strong> — EC2 호스트에 물리적으로 연결된 임시 저장소입니다. 빠른 작업 공간이나 재생성 가능한 캐시에 사용할 수 있으며 영구 보관용 데이터는 별도로 저장합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/concepts.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon EC2? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/gp.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Specifications for Amazon EC2 general purpose instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/co.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Specifications for Amazon EC2 compute optimized instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/mo.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Specifications for Amazon EC2 memory optimized instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-5\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/so.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Specifications for Amazon EC2 storage optimized instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-6\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/ac.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Specifications for Amazon EC2 accelerated computing instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-7\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/hpc.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Specifications for Amazon EC2 high-performance computing instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-8\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/instance-types.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EC2 instance types ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-9\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/instance-purchasing-options.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EC2 billing and purchasing options ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q002\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q012\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q016\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q016\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q016</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q016/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance must retain the same public IPv4 address after it restarts. Which resource should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 Access Point</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A change to the ENI MAC address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS PrivateLink</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">EIP</a>는 계정에 할당하는 고정 공인 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 주소다. 비용과 장애 조치 설계는 별개다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q026\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q026\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q026</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q026/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company is selecting a new EC2 instance for CPU-intensive image encoding. Which instance family should it evaluate first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q026\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute optimized</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q026\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Burstable micro instances only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q026\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Storage optimized only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q026\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Memory optimized only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 중심 워크로드는 컴퓨팅 최적화 패밀리를 우선 검토한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q027\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q027\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q027</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q027/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to repeatedly launch EC2 instances with the same operating system and application. Which template should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q027\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 시작 이미지를 제공한다. 런타임의 변경 데이터는 별도 저장해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">이전 용어 <b>EBS Snapshot</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">다음 용어 <b>EC2 Auto Scaling</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
